The sequence and activity-first pedagogy were informed by \emph{Active Calculus, Single Variable, 2nd Edition}. Intuitive and historical perspectives were informed by Silvanus P. Thompson's \emph{Calculus Made Easy}. Traditional exercise patterns were checked against the public-domain Granville--Smith and Greenhill texts. BetterGrades prose, examples, exercises, route structure, and graph specifications are independently written unless explicitly attributed.
\end{bgsource}
